<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="the-player">The player</h1>
<p>The music player (0.42.0): a record's tracks on one persistent player — a
streaming row plays in place, a locked row links to the record's buy door —
and the one-row now-playing strip.</p>

<section class="surfdoc-player" data-player="" data-layout="list" data-album="Time Traveler" data-artist="Scouter" data-art="/img/time-traveler.png" data-buy="#buy"><ol class="surfdoc-player-tracks"><li class="surfdoc-player-item"><a class="surfdoc-player-track surfdoc-player-locked" href="#buy" data-locked="" aria-label="Broken Hearted, on the full album"><span class="surfdoc-player-num"><span class="surfdoc-player-index">1</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-main"><span class="surfdoc-player-title">Broken Hearted</span><span class="surfdoc-player-line">Chapter 1 · Ordinary World</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-buy"><span class="surfdoc-player-lock" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Full album</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-time">1:55</span></a></li><li class="surfdoc-player-item"><a class="surfdoc-player-track surfdoc-player-locked" href="#buy" data-locked="" aria-label="Where the Cold Wind Blows, on the full album"><span class="surfdoc-player-num"><span class="surfdoc-player-index">2</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-main"><span class="surfdoc-player-title">Where the Cold Wind Blows</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-buy"><span class="surfdoc-player-lock" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Full album</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-time">2:06</span></a></li><li class="surfdoc-player-item"><button type="button" class="surfdoc-player-track" data-src="/audio/time-traveler.mp3" data-title="Time Traveler" data-duration="2:54" aria-label="Play Time Traveler"><span class="surfdoc-player-num"><span class="surfdoc-player-index">3</span><span class="surfdoc-player-eq" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-main"><span class="surfdoc-player-title">Time Traveler</span><span class="surfdoc-player-line">Chapter 4 · Meeting the Mentor</span></span><span class="surfdoc-player-time">2:54</span></button></li><li class="surfdoc-player-item"><button type="button" class="surfdoc-play